'''Whitney''' (Japanese: '''アカネ''' ''Akane'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Heal 60 damage from 1 of your {{TCGP|Miltank}}, and it recovers from being {{TCG|Asleep}}, {{TCG|Paralyzed}}, and {{TCG|Confused}}.
}}

