==Trivia==
* {{TCG|Whitney}} also exists in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Whitney]] is a [[Gym Leader]] in {{game5|Gold|Silver|Crystal|HeartGold|SoulSilver}}.
**{{p|Miltank}}, supported by this card, is Whitney's signature Pokémon. She uses one in all games she appears in.

